WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.399
Week 12: Shopping, Clothing, and Demonstratives. ask for an item and size compare price and fit return or exchange a purchase

2
00:00:08.399 --> 00:00:21.921
Operational objective. By the end of this section you can ask for an item and size, compare price and fit, return or exchange a purchase. The focus is useful performance, not isolated terminology.

3
00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:29.659
Language system. Demonstratives; colors; numbers above one hundred; adjective placement; quedar and costar.

4
00:00:29.659 --> 00:00:35.349
Sound and delivery. Voiced approximants b, d, and g between vowels.

5
00:00:35.349 --> 00:00:44.882
Core principle. Notice meaning first, then form. Retrieve the new language aloud, compare it with the model, and repair one feature at a time.

6
00:00:44.882 --> 00:01:11.161
Model language. ¿Tiene esta camisa en otra talla? — Do you have this shirt in another size? Esos zapatos me quedan bien. — Those shoes fit me well. Aquella chaqueta es demasiado cara. — That jacket over there is too expensive. Quiero devolver este artículo. — I want to return this item. El precio incluye los impuestos. — The price includes taxes.

7
00:01:11.161 --> 00:01:21.315
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
